        <mxCell id="title" value="The model map: every stock, flow and lever, by module" style="html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="676" height="37" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Tinted panel: a module. Box: a stock. Hourglass: a flow (its valve), named below. Cloud: a source or sink&#10;outside the model's stocks.&#10;Thick arrow (a pipe): what a flow moves, from a stock or cloud through its valve into a stock. A flow that&#10;only reduces a stock as it moves people (vacancies filled) has a thin arrow from its valve to that stock.&#10;Dotted thick line: a valve whose flow moves staff between members of Headcount (promotion, switching between&#10;employers, visa to local), so nothing enters or leaves Headcount.&#10;Grey italic: a lever. Dashed arrow: the first stocks and flows the lever reaches through auxiliaries&#10;(docs/model/edges.csv).&#10;A lever reaching more than 4 has one dashed arrow per other module, labelled with the lever and its count&#10;there, and &quot;(acts on N in this module)&quot; for its own module;&#10;the model guide's table &quot;Where the wide levers act&quot; (docs/model-guide.md) lists the targets." style="html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#FAFAFA;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="1390" width="770" height="177" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="caption:1" value="Left out: the auxiliaries, the parameters that are not levers, and the information links between stocks. The&#10;module pages and the causal-loop panels show them (docs/model-reference.pdf, docs/model/diagrams/)." style="html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="1390" width="770" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="caption:2" value="Pipes: tools/flow_pipes.csv, each cited to the line of the integration code that fills or drains the stock." style="html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="1450" width="763" height="27" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
